          "type": "text",
          "text": "LightningParse: Hybrid Rust-Python PDF Extraction",
          "bbox": [
            108.19999694824219,
            741.8499755859375,
            402.1999969482422,
            753.8499755859375
          ],
          "section_id": "header",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Anonymous Authors, Example University",
          "bbox": [
            215.4199981689453,
            703.9600219726562,
            437.4199981689453,
            715.9600219726562
          ],
          "section_id": "header",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Abstract",
          "bbox": [
            285.7200012207031,
            664.280029296875,
            333.7200012207031,
            676.280029296875
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We present LightningParse, combining Rust parallel extraction with Python NLP integration. Achieves 47x median speedup on",
          "bbox": [
            31.18000030517578,
            646.1500244140625,
            757.1800003051758,
            658.1500244140625
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "digital-native PDFs.",
          "bbox": [
            31.18000030517578,
            631.97998046875,
            151.18000030517578,
            643.97998046875
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I. Introduction",
          "bbox": [
            31.18000030517578,
            607.5800170898438,
            121.18000030517578,
            619.5800170898438
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "II. Architecture",
          "bbox": [
            308.9800109863281,
            607.5800170898438,
            404.9800109863281,
            619.5800170898438
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Recent advances in document parsing have demonstrated",
          "bbox": [
            31.18000030517578,
            592.2899780273438,
            349.1800003051758,
            604.2899780273438
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The proposed pipeline operates in two tiers. Tier 1 handles",
          "bbox": [
            308.9800109863281,
            592.2899780273438,
            662.9800109863281,
            604.2899780273438
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "that parallel extraction architectures can significantly",
          "bbox": [
            31.18000030517578,
            578.1199951171875,
            367.1800003051758,
            590.1199951171875
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "digitally-authored PDFs by directly parsing the content",
          "bbox": [
            308.9800109863281,
            578.1199951171875,
            638.9800109863281,
            590.1199951171875
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "outperform traditional sequential approaches.",
          "bbox": [
            31.18000030517578,
            563.9500122070312,
            301.1800003051758,
            575.9500122070312
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "stream operators.",
          "bbox": [
            308.9800109863281,
            563.9500122070312,
            410.9800109863281,
            575.9500122070312
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1",
          "bbox": [
            303.5,
            39.81999969482422,
            309.5,
            51.81999969482422
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_num": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "III. Extraction",
          "bbox": [
            31.18000030517578,
            752.1500244140625,
            121.18000030517578,
            764.1500244140625
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "IV. OCR Fallback",
          "bbox": [
            308.9800109863281,
            752.1500244140625,
            404.9800109863281,
            764.1500244140625
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Experimental evaluation on a corpus of 50 documents shows",
          "bbox": [
            31.18000030517578,
            736.8599853515625,
            373.1800003051758,
            748.8599853515625
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Font metric resolution is critical for accurate bounding box",
          "bbox": [
            308.9800109863281,
            736.8599853515625,
            668.9800109863281,
            748.8599853515625
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "a median speedup of 47x over baseline Python libraries.",
          "bbox": [
            31.18000030517578,
            722.6900024414062,
            361.1800003051758,
            734.6900024414062
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "computation.",
          "bbox": [
            308.9800109863281,
            722.6900024414062,
            380.9800109863281,
            734.6900024414062
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2",
          "bbox": [
            303.5,
            39.81999969482422,
            309.5,
            51.81999969482422
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_num": 3,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "V. Font Metrics",
          "bbox": [
            31.18000030517578,
            752.1500244140625,
            121.18000030517578,
            764.1500244140625
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "VI. Headers",
          "bbox": [
            308.9800109863281,
            752.1500244140625,
            374.9800109863281,
            764.1500244140625
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Header and footer detection uses a heuristic approach based",
          "bbox": [
            31.18000030517578,
            736.8599853515625,
            385.1800003051758,
            748.8599853515625
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Reading order reconstruction sorts blocks by vertical position",
          "bbox": [
            308.9800109863281,
            736.8599853515625,
            680.9800109863281,
            748.8599853515625
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "on repeated text in page margins.",
          "bbox": [
            31.18000030517578,
            722.6900024414062,
            229.18000030517578,
            734.6900024414062
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "then applies column-detection.",
          "bbox": [
            308.9800109863281,
            722.6900024414062,
            488.9800109863281,
            734.6900024414062
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3",
          "bbox": [
            303.5,
            39.81999969482422,
            309.5,
            51.81999969482422
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_num": 4,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "VII. Reading Order",
          "bbox": [
            31.18000030517578,
            752.1500244140625,
            139.18000030517578,
            764.1500244140625
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "VIII. Results",
          "bbox": [
            308.9800109863281,
            752.1500244140625,
            386.9800109863281,
            764.1500244140625
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The FFI boundary between Rust and Python uses JSON",
          "bbox": [
            31.18000030517578,
            736.8599853515625,
            331.1800003051758,
            748.8599853515625
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Future work includes structured table extraction for",
          "bbox": [
            308.9800109863281,
            736.8599853515625,
            620.9800109863281,
            748.8599853515625
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "serialization with less than 2 percent overhead.",
          "bbox": [
            31.18000030517578,
            722.6900024414062,
            319.1800003051758,
            734.6900024414062
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "grid-aligned text blocks.",
          "bbox": [
            308.9800109863281,
            722.6900024414062,
            458.9800109863281,
            734.6900024414062
          ],
          "section_id": "body",
          "source": "digital"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4",
          "bbox": [
